-- "Taming the Beast" for Forsaken and human hunters: the level 10 chains that give the pet skills.
--   Forsaken: 25076 -> 25077 -> 25078 (Dedlow Wormwood, Brill) -> 25083 (Apolos, Undercity) - Blizzard's
--             unreleased chain from the Cataclysm data, with its Plagued Bruin (39049)
--   Human:    26100 -> 26101 -> 26102 (Benjamin Foxworthy, Goldshire) -> 26103 (Karrina Mekenda, Stormwind)
-- GENERATED by client-patches/hunter-trainers/build_hunter_taming.py together with the client rows (Spell.dbc,
-- Item.dbc in patch-Z) - edit the builder, not this file.
