    `LogDescription` = 'Read the Etched Letter and speak to Ashley Blank outside Northshire Abbey.',
    `QuestDescription` = 'I was asked to bring this to your attention as soon as you returned from the kobold camps, $N. It appears to be a letter marked with the sign of Ashley Blank, who trains the hunters of Northshire. I wouldn''t hesitate to read it before you go about any other business here in the Abbey.', `VerifiedBuild` = 0;
