    `LogDescription` = 'Read the Etched Scroll and speak to Xavier the Huntsman in Deathknell.',
    `QuestDescription` = 'Ah, while you were off dealing with the mindless Scourge, this scroll arrived for you. I would think it''s some matter of importance as it seems it bears the mark of Xavier, the huntsman. I would take some time to read it before heading out again.', `VerifiedBuild` = 0;
